      "fact_text": "SINUMERIK can support both single part production and series production. More specifically, it can accommodate the production of special parts in universal machining centers and individual parts on cycle-controlled machines as well as large-scale, automated production. With single part production, SINUMERIK enables simple, intuitive and fast CNC programming to support operators’ interactions with machines during the entire manufacturing process.",
